    "title": "Macklemore announces 'Free Palestine' tour coming to Dublin - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jonathan Browne ,\n21 hours ago US rapper Macklemore has announced that he is coming to Dublin next month for his ‘Free Palestine’ tour. The American Grammy winner announced the tour, which will also stop in Paris and London, after he was dropped from Ed Sheeran’s ‘LOOP’ tour for his frequent ‘Free Palestine’ remarks on stage. Read full article",
